- Emergency privileges granted to administrators are exclusive to Emergency mode and must be revoked upon its conclusion.  
- Delegated roles assigned during Emergency mode must be revoked when Emergency mode ends. Delegated roles assigned before Emergency mode remain active unless expired or revoked.  
